{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Optimise.Learning_Rate</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"owl-base","href":"../../../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Owl_neural_generic","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Flatten","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Graph","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"argument-1"},{"name":"Neuron","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Optimise","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Learning_Rate","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Strategies for learning rate update</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-typ\"><a href=\"#type-typ\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> typ</span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-typ.Adagrad\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-typ.Adagrad\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Adagrad</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> float</span></code></li><li id=\"type-typ.Const\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-typ.Const\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Const</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> float</span></code></li><li id=\"type-typ.Decay\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-typ.Decay\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Decay</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> float * float</span></code></li><li id=\"type-typ.Exp_decay\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-typ.Exp_decay\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Exp_decay</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> float * float</span></code></li><li id=\"type-typ.RMSprop\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-typ.RMSprop\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">RMSprop</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> float * float</span></code></li><li id=\"type-typ.Adam\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-typ.Adam\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Adam</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> float * float * float</span></code></li><li id=\"type-typ.Schedule\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-typ.Schedule\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Schedule</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <span>float array</span></span></code></li></ol></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Representation of learning rate update strategies. Possible values include:</p><ul><li><code>Adam (alpha, beta1, beta2)</code>, see <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6980\">ref</a> for parameter meaning</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-run\"><a href=\"#val-run\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> run : <span><a href=\"#type-typ\">typ</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Execute the computations defined in module <code>typ</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-default\"><a href=\"#val-default\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> default : <span><a href=\"#type-typ\">typ</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-typ\">typ</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Create module <code>typ</code> with default values.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-update_ch\"><a href=\"#val-update_ch\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> update_ch : <span><a href=\"#type-typ\">typ</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Update the cache of gradients.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-update\"><a href=\"#val-update\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> update : \u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-typ\">typ</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>update typ i p' g' c</code> returns the weight update of step <code>i</code> from the search direction <code>p'</code>, the gradient <code>g'</code> and the gradient cache <code>c</code> (already updated with <code>update_ch</code>).</p><p>For <code>Adam</code> this is <code>-a_t * m / (sqrt v + 1e-8)</code> with the bias-corrected step <code>a_t = alpha * sqrt (1 - beta2^i) / (1 - beta1^i)</code>; it ignores <code>p'</code>, so Adam is only meaningful with <code>Gradient.GD</code>. For every other strategy it is <code>p' * run typ i g' c</code>. Use this rather than <code>run</code> for Adam: <code>run</code> divides by <code>g'</code>, which is wrong where the gradient is zero or tiny.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-scale\"><a href=\"#val-scale\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> scale : <span><a href=\"#type-typ\">typ</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> float</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>scale typ i</code> is the factor of the step-<code>i</code> update that depends on <code>i</code>: <code>update typ i p' g' c</code> equals <code>scale typ i * unscaled_update typ p' g' c</code> up to rounding. It is <code>1.</code> for <code>Adagrad</code> and <code>RMSprop</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-unscaled_update\"><a href=\"#val-unscaled_update\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> unscaled_update : \u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-typ\">typ</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>unscaled_update typ p' g' c</code> is the part of the update that does not depend on the step; see <code>scale</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-to_string\"><a href=\"#val-to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-typ\">typ</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Convert the module <code>typ</code> to its string representation.</p></div></div>"}